OL,3,GNEWSADog walker murdered in the woods,
OL,4,Asay police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice "strongly believe" a murder
OL,7,Fvictim was assaulted in the same
OL,8,Fwoodland where his body was later
OL,9,Fdiscovered.
OL,11,FGraham Pennycook, 64, was reported
OL,12,Fmissing when his dog came home without
OL,13,Fhim after he had left home on 24
OL,14,FSeptember for a walk close to Perham
OL,15,FDown in the Wiltshire town of
OL,16,FLudgershall.
OL,18,FWiltshire Police said his body was
OL,19,Fdiscovered in the woods later that day
OL,20,Fand a murder investigation was launched
OL,21,Fby its Major Crime Investigation Team.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
